&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://www.despairjasper.com/papers/Home_is_Peace_not_a_Place.pdf" >Home is peace, not a place: How does urban storytelling impact talent&amp;rsquo;s &amp;ldquo;vote with their feet&amp;rdquo;?&lt;/a>&lt;br>
