With Prof. Chao Feng, Dr. Xinmin Zhang, and Prof. Miao Wang. With Editor at &lt;em>The Economic Journal&lt;/em> (JCR 1, ABS4*)&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="#" >Weathering the tempest: Natural disasters and firm entry&lt;/a>&lt;br>
With Prof. Chao Feng, Dr. Xinmin Zhang, and Xiaoyin Yang. With Editor at &lt;em>Economic Geography&lt;/em> (JCR 1, ABS3)&lt;/p>
